[{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_02_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_02_9999","text":"音响监督"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_02_0010","text":"…………那么，从那里到AI觉醒为止\n就是下一话的剧情了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_02_0020","text":"嗯，我明白了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_02_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_02_0030","text":"真是对不起啊，总是让你跟着折腾\n导演的剧本，好像一拖再拖"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_02_0040","text":"哪里哪里，请别在意！\n每次都很期待后续，就像追周刊连载一样开心"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_02_0050","text":"黛小姐的演技，我们工作人员\n一直在说很棒呢。下周也拜托了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_02_0060","text":"嘿嘿，谢谢！\n请多关照！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_02_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_02_0003","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_02_0070","text":"过来，小P"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_02_0005","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_02_0080","text":"散步的时间到了哦……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_02_0090","text":"？小P……？\n到外面……来……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_02_0004","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_02_0100","text":"…………？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_02_0110","text":"如果有什么阻碍了你的天空的话————"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_02_0006","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_02_0007","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_02_0120","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_02_0008","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_02_0009","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_02_0130","text":"──────……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_02_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_02_0140","text":"……\n怎么了？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_02_0012","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_02_0150","text":"有什么事吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_02_0160","text":"……\n我搞错了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_02_0013","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_02_0014","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_02_0015","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_02_0170","text":"谢谢您\n这么设身处地地为偶像们着想……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_02_9998","text":"企划策划人"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_02_0180","text":"哪里哪里……嗯，让大家亲手创作作品这件事，\n毕竟只是对外宣传的概念"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_02_0190","text":"实际上，会有专业人士来负责，\n这点请放心"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_02_0200","text":"…………诶？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_02_0016","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_02_0017","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_02_0210","text":"…………好重……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_02_9997","text":"舞蹈教练"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_02_0220","text":"──────！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_02_0018","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_02_0230","text":"……\n啊——……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_02_0240","text":"──────！\n──────！！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_02_0019","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_02_0250","text":"好碍事啊……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_02_0260","text":"————啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_02_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_02_0023","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_02_0270","text":"对不起，打扰你们了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_02_0280","text":"诶，诶……\n────不是……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_02_0290","text":"关于制作人的企划的事，\n大家商量着能不能找时间一起聊聊……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_02_0300","text":"啊……\n谢谢您……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_02_0025","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_02_0310","text":"等有时间了再联系你\n那就……打扰了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_02_0024","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_02_0026","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_02_0027","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_02_0320","text":"真是碍事…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_02_0330","text":"──────这具身体"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_02_0340","text":"如果有什么阻碍了你的天空的话————"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_02_0350","text":"你会在此休憩羽翼吗\n还是说…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_02_9996","text":"通信语音AGI"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_02_0360","text":"────检测到接近"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_02_0370","text":"流星群正在接近"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_02_0380","text":"流星────────"}]
